  "content": "<h2>雲之靴</h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q2CUAyS.png\" alt=\"雲之靴橫幅\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/f8Nnj5VuFj\" style=\"display:inline-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_64h.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftiviacz1337\" style=\"display:inline-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\">\n  </a>\n</p><h2>功能</h2><p><strong>雲之靴</strong> - 舊版雲之靴（無法取得）<br>\n<strong>鐵雲之靴</strong> - 額外 5% 速度、跳躍提升 II、摔落傷害免疫<br>\n<strong>金雲之靴</strong> - 額外 10% 速度、跳躍提升 III、摔落傷害免疫<br>\n<strong>鑽石雲之靴</strong> - 額外 15% 速度、跳躍提升 IV、摔落傷害免疫<br>\n<strong>獄髓雲之靴</strong> - 額外 20% 速度、跳躍提升 V、摔落傷害免疫</p><p><strong>黃金羽毛</strong> - 若玩家在主手或副手持有此物品，將獲得 <strong>摔落傷害免疫</strong>。黃金羽毛擁有 385 點耐久度，可用金錠修復。若已安裝 Curios API 或 Trinkets（Trinkets 1.17.1+），可裝備於 Curio/Trinket 欄位。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3WiRD6M.png\" alt=\"圖鑑\"></p><h2>合成配方</h2><ul>\n<li>黃金羽毛</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a4PCgJ0.png\" alt=\"配方2\"></p><ul>\n<li>雲之靴</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UhwRraX.gif\" alt=\"配方\"></p>",
